                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5a277ae9-7dec-35bc-9761-b2db3537d850",
                        "entry_id": "5a20881c-a054-3d3f-8a26-941c6f7deb44",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui pratique la skoliosexualité."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bc1b6c9-e795-42be-88f1-fc194fb49f6b",
                                "sense_id": "5a277ae9-7dec-35bc-9761-b2db3537d850",
                                "text": "Un individu skoliosexuel peut aussi être attiré par les personnes qui ne se définissent pas en tant que cisgenre."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a110b34-a1a0-454f-a172-409d1f280d0a",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a20881c-a054-3d3f-8a26-941c6f7deb44",
                        "source_sense_id": "5a277ae9-7dec-35bc-9761-b2db3537d850",
                        "target_lang_word": "skoliosexuell",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "skoliosexuell",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c49efd5b-fa65-3b58-9720-e73ce20686f0",
                                        "entry_id": "6a13bc23-4acd-3a8e-9281-acdd13fae5e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sexuelle Neigung zu nichtbinären Menschen habend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0894c50e-81a1-4e0d-a662-483db0c8ca06",
                                                "sense_id": "c49efd5b-fa65-3b58-9720-e73ce20686f0",
                                                "text": "„Eine skoliosexuelle Person fühlt sich körperlich und sexuell ausschließlich zu nichtbinären Menschen hingezogen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c829e5f-f79d-4ae0-abdd-f905f9c8d94a",
                                                "sense_id": "c49efd5b-fa65-3b58-9720-e73ce20686f0",
                                                "text": "„Skoliosexuelle Menschen bevorzugen nicht-binäre Menschen als (Sexual-)Partner*innen [sic].“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8b3d15a-ee17-474e-81ac-09a48250ffd4",
                                                "sense_id": "c49efd5b-fa65-3b58-9720-e73ce20686f0",
                                                "text": "„Homo-, hetero, bi-, pan- und skoliosexuell – Was genau hat sexuelle Orientierung jetzt eigentlich mit Pfannen und Skoliose zu tun?“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "246cc920-5288-488a-8872-782a601f061d",
                                                "sense_id": "c49efd5b-fa65-3b58-9720-e73ce20686f0",
                                                "text": "„Eine skoliosexuelle Person fühlt sich emotional, körperlich und sexuell zu nicht binären Menschen hingezogen, also Menschen, die sich nicht eindeutig als Mann oder als Frau fühlen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8ea6e67-d125-43d3-8925-19cf09c3bce5",
                                                "sense_id": "c49efd5b-fa65-3b58-9720-e73ce20686f0",
                                                "text": "„Wer skoliosexuell ist, der fühlt sich zu Trans*-Menschen [sic] hingezogen oder zu Menschen, die sich nicht in das binäre (also zweiteiliges) System aus Mann und Frau einordnen wollen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5823c831-54f4-48bf-bcd5-d573ffabcd43",
                                                "sense_id": "c49efd5b-fa65-3b58-9720-e73ce20686f0",
                                                "text": "„Wer sich also als skoliosexuell outet, fühlt sich körperlich und seelisch zu jenen hingezogen, die sich keinem eindeutigen Geschlecht zuordnen lassen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f223cb86-9a46-4089-87c2-ba139c244966",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a20881c-a054-3d3f-8a26-941c6f7deb44",
                        "source_sense_id": "5a277ae9-7dec-35bc-9761-b2db3537d850",
                        "target_lang_word": "skoliosexual",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "skoliosexual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b859565b-7794-31d7-8ec2-a30f6588a77e",
                                        "entry_id": "fc64a14b-876f-3f16-baea-ada3f2c5e170",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexually attracted to non-cisgender people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3436e097-9776-4749-8142-6d8ef718dcb0",
                                                "sense_id": "b859565b-7794-31d7-8ec2-a30f6588a77e",
                                                "text": "There is a silence surrounding sexualities such as genderqueer, skoliosexual, pansexual and asexual. These 'other' sexualities operate outside of the traditional sex-gender-desire binaries that now frame both same-sex and opposite-sex attraction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e7ced84-7879-44ce-8ba6-cc5cd67b8ece",
                                                "sense_id": "b859565b-7794-31d7-8ec2-a30f6588a77e",
                                                "text": "However, these identities are only a few of those that fall under the umbrella term queer, which includes other identities such as pansexual, asexual, demisexual, skoliosexual, polysexual, same gender loving, kink, polyamorous, and others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6232dda-02ad-43db-ad33-a8a5806b77a3",
                                                "sense_id": "b859565b-7794-31d7-8ec2-a30f6588a77e",
                                                "text": "Cultural diversity is a term that refers to many groups defined on bases other than those that distinguish traditional cultural or ethnic groups: Sexual orientation, such as lesbian, gay, bisexual, pansexual, androsexual, skoliosexual, asexual, or questioning; Gender identity, such as transgender, nonbinary, or fluid; Deaf culture, representing those with hearing impairments; Physical disabilities, such as the \"wheelchair culture\"..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
